        "title": "Present Simple — настоящее обычное",
        "text": "Мы используем Present Simple, когда говорим о привычках, фактах и том, что происходит регулярно.",
        "examples": [
          "I work every day.",
          "The sun rises in the east."
        ]
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "card",
      "order": 2,
      "content": {
        "title": "Когда используется Present Simple",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "clock",
            "title": "Привычки",
            "example": "I drink coffee in the morning."
          },
          {
            "icon": "globe",
            "title": "Факты",
            "example": "Water boils at 100°C."
          },
          {
            "icon": "calendar",
            "title": "Расписания",
            "example": "The train leaves at 7 a.m."
          }
        ]
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "quiz",
      "order": 3,
      "content": {
        "question": "Где здесь нужен Present Simple?",
        "items": [
          {
            "sentence": "I ___ coffee every morning",
            "options": ["drink", "am drinking"],
            "correct": "drink",
            "explanation": "Фраза every morning говорит о регулярности."
          },
          {
            "sentence": "I ___ coffee right now",
            "options": ["drink", "am drinking"],
            "correct": "am drinking",
            "explanation": "Right now — это момент речи."
          }
        ]
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "card",
      "order": 4,
      "content": {
        "title": "Формула Present Simple",
        "formula": [
          "I / You / We / They + verb",
          "He / She / It + verb + s"
        ],
        "examples": [
          "I work",
          "You like pizza",
          "He works",
          "She likes pizza"
        ],
        "note": "Буква -s добавляется только для he / she / it"
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 105,
      "type": "trap",
      "order": 5,
      "content": {
        "title": "Типичная ошибка",
        "sentence": "He work in an office.",
        "question": "Что здесь неправильно?",
        "options": ["work", "in", "an office"],
        "correct": "work",
        "explanation": "Для he / she / it глагол всегда с окончанием -s."
      }
    },

